"GTK4/Wayland-native interfeysi bilan Linux uchun zamonaviy ulanish menejeri. "
"SSH, RDP, VNC, SPICE, Telnet, Serial, Kubernetes va Zero Trust ulanishlarini "
"bitta dasturdan boshqaring."

